# PR 18 (stack18) replaced the botocore git submodule with vendored
# files in share/. CI workflows fetch botocore on the fly into
# `botocore/` for backwards compatibility with gen_classes.pl.
# Anchor with leading slash so this only matches the repo-root
# `botocore/` checkout dir and not the tracked `share/botocore/`
# vendored tree.
/botocore/

# share/{smithy,botocore} get populated by `make dist-prep` (see
# script/paws-vendor-{smithy,botocore}) immediately before `dzil
# build`. The populated content is large (~100MB raw, ~27MB
# compressed in the dist tarball) and regeneratable from upstream
# at the SHA pinned in share/botocore/.upstream-sha + the smithy
# vendor source pinned in script/paws-vendor-smithy. Keep the
# tracked entries (.placeholder + .upstream-sha) so the layout
# documents itself and the refresh-source-deps workflow has a SHA
# file to bump.
/share/smithy/*
!/share/smithy/.placeholder
/share/botocore/*
!/share/botocore/.placeholder
!/share/botocore/.upstream-sha

# Emacs save files:
*~
